# The key is computed from ts, and ts's order is not the key's order: the
# earliest times of day come from the 24th, 48th and 72nd rows.

query
EXPLAIN SELECT ts::TIME AS t FROM vt_idx ORDER BY ts::TIME LIMIT 3;
----
QUERY PLAN
╭─ TOP_N ──────────╮
│ Top: 3           │
│ Order By: t ASC  │
│ ~3 rows          │
